{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以右手無名指取香水，彈灑曼拏囉上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彈三遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以右手無名指取香水，於曼拏囉上右旋作一圓相，表福智圓滿故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "就念真言一遍，作圓相一匝，次加持花米成光明種，如用之時，悉成如意珍寶供具。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念真言時，以右手拈花米三次畢，次雙手拈花米放曼拏囉上，右旋散灑，如空注雨。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "輪圍山　鐵\n圍山"}
